### Fresh-task production fan-out

At resolution, stop after publishing the durable answer and creating the native implementation, security-review, and qualification tickets required by the decision. Invoke `handoff` to create a redacted orchestration continuation under the operating-system temporary directory. Reference the resolution and immutable evidence rather than copying them; include suggested skills and each receiving task's exact authority boundary.

The fresh orchestration task may dispatch only independently unblocked work. Its handoff and prompts must name:

- production evidence-producer implementation;
- independent review/adjudication issuer implementation;
- independent security design and exact-artifact review, with no implementation self-approval;
- `hatchery` and work-mac qualification as separate tasks against the same immutable candidate, each owning only its host evidence; and
- the parallel Agent Equipment controller and reusable crypto-trust lanes, which may consume authenticated evidence but must not define or mint it.

Every sibling receives the others' task identities, purpose, owned issue and edit/evidence scope, prohibited overlap, and [coordinated release contract](https://github.com/nisavid/agents/issues/45) convergence point. No successor receives live inference, credential, promotion, publication, or host-mutation authority merely from this decision.
